WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:14.116
The Knowledge Library is a set of trusted documents for your kind of business, from food safety rules to customer service, that your team and Worklynq’s AI can rely on. In this video, you’ll set it up and find your way around.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:22.432
The first time someone opens it, the library asks what kind of business you are. Your company’s industry is already picked.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:27.901
Pick one or more. A café might also do catering, or run a shop. Then click Next.

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:34.425
Then it suggests the collections that fit, already ticked. Add or remove any, and create your library.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:45.960
Here’s a café’s library. Business areas like operations, the team, and health and safety, and areas for your industry, like the kitchen and menu, or catering and events.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:52.992
Each collection holds its documents, and pages open and edit just like Spaces, so you can make them your own.

00:00:53.433 --> 00:01:00.836
Search knowledge, at the top, finds any document across every collection, and Choose collections changes the set any time.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:09.129
Everyone can search it, and Worklynq’s AI uses it as trusted context, so its answers follow how your business really works.

